    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1327">

                <pb facs="0895" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/100.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Davis to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guadalajara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 17, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Government threatening attachment Compañía Galletera Nacional, notwithstanding my
                    formal protest. See my dispatch 508, September 10, and instruct.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
